#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1073-A expect=violation domain=TR
#note "The OTHER THREE prohibited qualifiers (TRLAT, TRDIR, TRPORTOT) present, deliberately NO TRLOC. Since the D-15 rewrite (2026-09-12) the membership Check is evaluated per variable, so three prohibited columns are THREE findings, each naming its culprit - the pre-rewrite dataset-level or-tree (BroadcastFold) collapsed exactly this dataset to a single anonymous finding (count was 1). This scenario is the count-direction witness: the rewrite can only keep or RAISE the finding count, never lower it."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#expectViolationCount 3
#expectViolationAt variable_name=TRLAT
#expectViolationAt variable_name=TRDIR
#expectViolationAt variable_name=TRPORTOT
dataset TR label="Tumor Results"
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col TRSEQ    type=Num
col TRTESTCD type=Char
col TRLAT    type=Char label="Laterality"
col TRDIR    type=Char label="Directionality"
col TRPORTOT type=Char label="Portion or Totality"
---
S1 | TR | 001 | 1 | LDIAM | LEFT | PROXIMAL | ENTIRE
---
